      "en": "(a) Let $f\\in\\mathcal{S}^{\\prime}(\\mathbb{R})$ and assume that the support of $f$ is contained in $\\{x\\geq0\\}$. Show that the Fourier transform of $f$ is an analytic function in the half-plane $\\operatorname{Im}\\xi<0$.\n\n(b) Let $f,g\\in\\mathcal{S}^{\\prime}(\\mathbb{R})$ have support in $\\{x\\geq0\\}$. Show that $f*g$ also has support in $\\{x\\geq0\\}$ and that \\eqref{eq:fourier-convolution-product-test-functions} holds (in the pointwise sense) in the lower half-plane.",
      "zh": "(a) 设 $f\\in\\mathcal{S}^{\\prime}(\\mathbb{R})$, 并假设 $f$ 的支集包含于 $\\{x\\geq0\\}$. 证明 $f$ 的 Fourier 变换是半平面 $\\operatorname{Im}\\xi<0$ 内的解析函数.\n\n(b) 设 $f,g\\in\\mathcal{S}^{\\prime}(\\mathbb{R})$ 的支集位于 $\\{x\\geq0\\}$. 证明 $f*g$ 的支集也位于 $\\{x\\geq0\\}$, 且 \\eqref{eq:fourier-convolution-product-test-functions} 在下半平面内成立 (按逐点意义).",
